    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>About us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twitter:<strong>@CottonStudio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Youtube:<strong>@Cotton Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bugs&amp;Feedbacks:<strong>Feedback</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Lilliput's Workshop is a logic puzzle game based on an automated sandbox. If you've played SpaceChem or worked on redstone circuits in MineCraft, then Lilliput's Workshop is also worth a try.<br><br>The game allows you to assemble a track system using various parts to guide a small train that transports blocks of a specific shape to their destination and complete the task. You can also use the game's built-in level editor to create your own unique levels and share them with players around the world via the internet to challenge their minds.<br><br>Lilliput's Workshop uses a nostalgic, childlike art style. Even if you're not interested in boring logical thinking, we hope you'll experience the same pure fun from this game as you did when you were a child building castles out of blocks.",
    "about_the_game": "Lilliput's Workshop is a logic puzzle game based on an automated sandbox. If you've played SpaceChem or worked on redstone circuits in MineCraft, then Lilliput's Workshop is also worth a try.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game allows you to assemble a track system using various parts to guide a small train that transports blocks of a specific shape to their destination and complete the task. You can also use the game's built-in level editor to create your own unique levels and share them with players around the world via the internet to challenge their minds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLilliput's Workshop uses a nostalgic, childlike art style. Even if you're not interested in boring logical thinking, we hope you'll experience the same pure fun from this game as you did when you were a child building castles out of blocks.",
    "short_description": "A sandbox logic puzzle game with a nostalgic temperament. You can experience the endless fun of designing automata here.",
